{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_05",
  "title": "Finish Line",
  "storyCode": "IC-5",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9f9ced4bfd4ad8b9d6363bb3aeb83718940afe24c759d98df0a39535bf31905d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g10_lakegarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Strange Machine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zumama, boat assembly: correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It looks structurally sound, but there are a few things we can tweak. For example—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There, that should make it more solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Strange Machine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zumama, Zumama: amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just the product of experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There you are, Zumama."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Inam? What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This survey equipment has to get across, right? I came to help since I didn't have anything else to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why are you thanking me? Looks like you're actually becoming one of these robots."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, I'm glad to make so many new friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Strange Machine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zumama, Zumama: friend!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And I've been trying to find a date for Lancet-2."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lancet-2 is the robot that came with Rhodes Island, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, she's my big sister now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not skilled enough to make a robot as smart as Lancet-2, so I'm trying to find one in this group."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're very nice, but not really her type."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She likes intellectuals, like the Doctor. It's a bit of a headache."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Never mind, you're not the only weirdo in Tiacauh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey everybody, this is Croque, and I've found a safer vantage point to continue the broadcast from."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How far until goal? 300m? Ah, forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's really important is that the architect Stitch Canvas, the only student of Master Finch, has found a boat and jumped into the race!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? Looks like he's talking to us. Let's zoom in and see what he's saying..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'I'm gonna win,' I think. Yup, I'm sure that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And he just raised his middle finger to show his motivation. Looks like there's a fiery heart beneath this architect's cold surface!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He may have gotten a late start, but that vehicle is definitely a huge advantage."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's closing the distance as we speak!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Things are pretty lively over there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wanted to say that this is what happens with Gavial around, but she's not the only one who's let her hair down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not used to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You have to get used to it, living in Acahualla."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You get so used to it I feel weird if there's no one arguing and making noise around me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're a proper Tiacauh now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Speaking of which, Zumama, if Gavial didn't come back the year before last, you were planning to become the Great Chief of Acahualla, weren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Becoming Great Chief wasn't the real goal; it was a way for me to prove myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wanted to build the most powerful machine ever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I knew I shouldn't have placed any expectations on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you thinking about being lord ameer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good to see that you and Tomimi have learned something about politics, unlike Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know how she's survived on the outside all these years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Some things we deal with as a matter of course just don't factor in for Gavial. Like adapting to your environment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha, that's true."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you want her to become lord ameer? Are you sure she's suitable?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pretty sure you could pick somebody off any street in Sargon and get a better lord ameer than her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Agreed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But if we're choosing a Tiacauh to lead Acahualla, there's no one more suitable than her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you speaking as a Tiacauh, or as a Sargon Messenger?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're entering the final stretch of the race!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gavial remains in first place, but her lead continues to shrink."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not Avdotya who's closing the distance, though!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Despite her valiant effort, her choice of clothing has become dead weight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Literally, as the weight of her clothes is slowing her down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Meanwhile, Elysium is rapidly closing in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Conserving his strength in the first half, Elysium now shows off his true ability."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He has passed Avdotya and is almost neck-and-neck with Gavial!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "However—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Neither of them are aware of the true threat approaching!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm impressed with Elysium. I never thought he could catch up to Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His attitude is a mask. You can't get complacent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, I noticed. He doesn't want people to know how good he is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't change the subject."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, looks like you've learned a thing or two at Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not on purpose, but Master Closure makes me go to meetings about stuff besides technology, so I've heard a bunch of things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like she has high hopes for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for your question..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've lived in Acahualla for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Compared to city life, I prefer to stay in the jungles, watching you people fight over stupid things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe it's hard to believe, but for me, I'm a Tiacauh a Sargon Messenger at the same time. I don't have to pick."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or I guess I could say, my Sargon perspective tells me that Acahualla won't stay unexplored forever. That's why I hope you'll seize the opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I believe you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're headed towards a climax."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Exercising his explosive potential, Elysium has almost caught up to Gavial."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Avdotya's not out of this race yet, though, and she's still keeping pace with the two in front of her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No need to push it, Avdotya!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But now all three of them have noticed the threat approaching from behind—Stitch, riding in his boat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The wonders of machinery! He has caught up to the three in front of him in a very short period of time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Only a hundred meters to the goal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's like we're at the starting line again. Three swimmers and a boat, racing their way into the final stretch!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, Inam."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I won't help you convince her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gavial should not sit in that chair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll get the same answer if you ask Tomimi."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Figure it out for yourself. I'm busy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you have too much free time, you can help me build this boat while you think about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You really count every last coin, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Eighty meters!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Avdotya got caught in the boat's wake. She's coughing and she has to stop! Yes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, I mean, what a shame."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fifty meters!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Elysium tries to board the boat, but took an accidental hit from Master Edge, who is angry at Stitch, and falls back into the water!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are bubbles coming to the surface. Is he okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thirty meters!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Master Edge leaps from Gavial's back onto the Ale Keg, and hits Stitch on the head!\nOuch! That must have hurt!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, Ale Keg is the name that I just gave to this boat, following in the footsteps of my other masterpiece, 'The Great Aquapit'!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like the winner will be Ga—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, not quite!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The fight between Master Edge and Stitch has destroyed the boat's instruments!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's an ominous rumble coming from the Ale Keg!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She dashes ahead like an arrow!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not even Gavial can catch the out-of-control boat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The boat is the first to arrive at the goal!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The winner of this swimming contest is—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Ale Keg!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, it's not over yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Ale Keg isn't satisfied with simply crossing the finish line!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She rushes ashore and charges toward the cave-in!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Boom!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Master Edge and Stitch are thrown from the boat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Ale Keg has put a huge hole in the rock blocking the tunnel exit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Poor Ale Keg, never to taste the breakfast of champions!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Announcement From Afar",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A moment of silence for her!"
